('CC 1.2', 'Security', 'The board of directors demonstrates independence from management and exercises oversight of the development and performance of internal controls.', 'Operates Independently: The board of directors has sufficient members who are independent from management and objective in evaluations and decision making.', 'A list of all members of the board of directors and biographies, preferably from a published source', 12, 0),
('CC 1.2', 'Security', 'The board of directors demonstrates independence from management and exercises oversight of the development and performance of internal controls.', 'Supplements Board Expertise: The board of directors supplements its expertise relevant to security, availability, processing integrity, confidentiality, and privacy, as needed, through the use of a subcommittee and/or consultants.', 'Listing of organization''s committees reporting to the board of directors', 13, 0),
