('CC 1.5', 'Security', 'The organization holds individuals accountable for their intenal control responsibilities in the pursuite of objectives.', 'Establishes Performance Measures, Incentives, and Rewards: Management and the board of directors establish performance measures, incentives, and other rewards appropriate for responsibilities at all levels of the organization, reflecting appropriate dimensions of performance and expected standards of conduct, and considering the achievement of both short- and long-term objectives.', 'Employee manual or handbook, including code of conduct policy', 29, 0),
